  "video_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999",
  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "圆明园兽首走散了一百六十多年却还有五尊下落不明，敦煌几万卷经书被一箱一箱搬走却连清单都列不全，女史箴图被切成三段钉在木板上再也拼不回原样。从被锁进外国皇宫到整面墙被剥走，这十件流失文物的回家路一个比一个漫长#圆明园#流失海外的中国文物#国宝回家#中国文物#人一生要看的100个博物馆",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 365.133991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？据联合国教科文组织不完全统计，全世界四十七个国家的两百一十八家博物馆里藏着一百六十七万件中国文物流散在民间的更是馆藏的十倍之多可。要说哪一件最让人心疼，那说法可就多了。有人说是圆明园兽首，有人说是敦煌的经卷。错，真要论起心疼进兽首，连乾五都进不去。今天，咱们就来盘点中国流落海外的十大文物。先讲第十道，第六一件，比一剑揪心。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第十名。圆明园十二生肖兽首一八六零年，英法联军火烧圆圆明园海宴堂前喷泉上的十二尊兽首铜像被抢走了。一百多年来，他们散落在世界各地，直到最近这些年才有七尊回到了中国牛首。虎首猴首猪首鼠首兔首马首。这七尊通过拍卖和捐献陆续回来了，可还有五尊龙首蛇首养手棘手，狗手到现在下落不明。十二个铜脑袋走散了，一百六十多年只回来了，一半多，一家人被拆散了，您说这事上上儿说理去。第九名。河北易县辽代三彩罗汉。河北易县巴佛洼的山洞里，供着十六尊等身大的三彩罗汉，像每一尊都跟真人差不多大，面部表情，手指姿态一吻，褶皱做的跟活人一样。西方学者看了说，这双手比达芬奇画的蒙娜丽莎的手都好。可一百多年前，古董商把他们一尊一尊偷运出去，十六尊罗汉碎了五尊，剩下十一尊，散落。在全世界九个博物馆里，大英博物馆大都会博物馆、波士顿美术馆、集美博物馆、加拿大皇家安大略博物馆。您想想，依山洞的罗汉本来整整齐齐坐着，现在被拆散到五六个国家，再也凑不齐了。第八名，龙门石窟帝后礼佛图，北魏时期，洛阳龙门石窟冰阳中洞刻着两幅大型浮雕，一副是孝文帝李佛图，一幅是文昭皇后礼佛图合称帝后里佛土。这是中国石窟里最精美的北魏时刻。可上世纪三十年代古董商跟美国人勾结，把这两幅浮雕从石壁上凿下来，砸碎偷运出境。孝文帝李佛图卖给了纽约大都会博物馆。文昭皇后李佛图卖给了堪萨斯纳尔逊博物馆，您去龙门石窟看看。宾阳中洞那面墙上现在只剩两个大窟窿，石头早走了，只剩伤痕。第七名，唐，弘应景，克食这块石头在旅顺。黄金山上刻着二十九个字是唐朝。开元年间，洪兄卿催新奉旨册封东北地方政权回来时，路过旅顺凿带，距今一千三百多年。这是唐朝对东北行使管辖权的铁证。一九零八年日俄战争以后，日本海军把这块石头和碑亭移起，当成战利品，运回的日本献给了日本皇宫，藏在皇宫里的建安府蜜，不是人一百多年了。中国民间多次追讨，日本方面至今没有正式答复。一块石头，一千三百年，被锁在别人家的皇宫里。第六名，王羲之丧乱帖书圣王羲之的字真迹早就没有了，传世的都是魔本。丧乱铁是唐代内府双沟田末模本，被学者认为是王羲之传世书籍中最好的一幅。唐朝的时候，由遣唐使带到了日本，先藏在东大寺。后来辗转到了日本皇室手里，一千多年来一直密藏。在日本宫内厅，从不对外展出，一直到二零零六年，他才第一次回到中国展出。在上海博物馆待了没几天，又回去了，一千三百年就回来。过这么一次。从第十道第六兽首走散了，一百六十多年罗汉被拆散到五六个国家。帝后李佛图只剩两个窟窿，红垦井刻石锁在日本皇宫，丧乱铁一千年只回来过一次。可这五件还不是最让人心疼的。接下来第五道第一一件比一件揪心，有一件被大英博物馆切成好几块，装在了木板上。还有一件整面墙被剥走了，它是哪件？他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 830,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1210,
      "end_ms": 4470,
      "text": "据联合国教科文组织不完全统计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5270,
      "end_ms": 20930,
      "text": "全世界四十七个国家的两百一十八家博物馆里藏着一百六十七万件中国文物流散在民间的更是馆藏的十倍之多可。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00004",
      "start_ms": 20930,
      "end_ms": 23730,
      "text": "要说哪一件最让人心疼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00005",
      "start_ms": 24210,
      "end_ms": 25530,
      "text": "那说法可就多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00006",
      "start_ms": 26270,
      "end_ms": 28350,
      "text": "有人说是圆明园兽首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00007",
      "start_ms": 28750,
      "end_ms": 30580,
      "text": "有人说是敦煌的经卷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00008",
      "start_ms": 31160,
      "end_ms": 31400,
      "text": "错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00009",
      "start_ms": 31780,
      "end_ms": 33840,
      "text": "真要论起心疼进兽首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00010",
      "start_ms": 33840,
      "end_ms": 35140,
      "text": "连乾五都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00011",
      "start_ms": 35600,
      "end_ms": 36040,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00012",
      "start_ms": 36220,
      "end_ms": 40340,
      "text": "咱们就来盘点中国流落海外的十大文物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00013",
      "start_ms": 40460,
      "end_ms": 41480,
      "text": "先讲第十道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00014",
      "start_ms": 41480,
      "end_ms": 42620,
      "text": "第六一件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00015",
      "start_ms": 42620,
      "end_ms": 43620,
      "text": "比一剑揪心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00016",
      "start_ms": 44300,
      "end_ms": 45000,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00017",
      "start_ms": 45320,
      "end_ms": 46200,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00018",
      "start_ms": 46540,
      "end_ms": 48660,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00019",
      "start_ms": 49020,
      "end_ms": 51100,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00020",
      "start_ms": 52220,
      "end_ms": 52900,
      "text": "第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00021",
      "start_ms": 53220,
      "end_ms": 57520,
      "text": "圆明园十二生肖兽首一八六零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00022",
      "start_ms": 57860,
      "end_ms": 66185,
      "text": "英法联军火烧圆圆明园海宴堂前喷泉上的十二尊兽首铜像被抢走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00023",
      "start_ms": 66920,
      "end_ms": 67860,
      "text": "一百多年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00024",
      "start_ms": 68060,
      "end_ms": 69945,
      "text": "他们散落在世界各地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00025",
      "start_ms": 70520,
      "end_ms": 75295,
      "text": "直到最近这些年才有七尊回到了中国牛首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00026",
      "start_ms": 75590,
      "end_ms": 79865,
      "text": "虎首猴首猪首鼠首兔首马首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00027",
      "start_ms": 80350,
      "end_ms": 84665,
      "text": "这七尊通过拍卖和捐献陆续回来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00028",
      "start_ms": 85120,
      "end_ms": 89655,
      "text": "可还有五尊龙首蛇首养手棘手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00029",
      "start_ms": 89930,
      "end_ms": 92415,
      "text": "狗手到现在下落不明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00030",
      "start_ms": 92780,
      "end_ms": 95160,
      "text": "十二个铜脑袋走散了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00031",
      "start_ms": 95160,
      "end_ms": 98040,
      "text": "一百六十多年只回来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00032",
      "start_ms": 98040,
      "end_ms": 98745,
      "text": "一半多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00033",
      "start_ms": 99700,
      "end_ms": 101465,
      "text": "一家人被拆散了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00034",
      "start_ms": 101660,
      "end_ms": 103685,
      "text": "您说这事上上儿说理去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00035",
      "start_ms": 104830,
      "end_ms": 105585,
      "text": "第九名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00036",
      "start_ms": 105960,
      "end_ms": 108935,
      "text": "河北易县辽代三彩罗汉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00037",
      "start_ms": 109640,
      "end_ms": 112175,
      "text": "河北易县巴佛洼的山洞里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00038",
      "start_ms": 112570,
      "end_ms": 116190,
      "text": "供着十六尊等身大的三彩罗汉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00039",
      "start_ms": 116190,
      "end_ms": 120430,
      "text": "像每一尊都跟真人差不多大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00040",
      "start_ms": 120590,
      "end_ms": 121635,
      "text": "面部表情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00041",
      "start_ms": 122040,
      "end_ms": 123700,
      "text": "手指姿态一吻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00042",
      "start_ms": 123700,
      "end_ms": 125825,
      "text": "褶皱做的跟活人一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00043",
      "start_ms": 126710,
      "end_ms": 128195,
      "text": "西方学者看了说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00044",
      "start_ms": 128560,
      "end_ms": 131535,
      "text": "这双手比达芬奇画的蒙娜丽莎的手都好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00045",
      "start_ms": 132290,
      "end_ms": 133435,
      "text": "可一百多年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00046",
      "start_ms": 134020,
      "end_ms": 136975,
      "text": "古董商把他们一尊一尊偷运出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00047",
      "start_ms": 137360,
      "end_ms": 139815,
      "text": "十六尊罗汉碎了五尊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00048",
      "start_ms": 140160,
      "end_ms": 141255,
      "text": "剩下十一尊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00049",
      "start_ms": 141700,
      "end_ms": 142160,
      "text": "散落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00050",
      "start_ms": 142160,
      "end_ms": 144315,
      "text": "在全世界九个博物馆里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00051",
      "start_ms": 145430,
      "end_ms": 155075,
      "text": "大英博物馆大都会博物馆、波士顿美术馆、集美博物馆、加拿大皇家安大略博物馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00052",
      "start_ms": 156200,
      "end_ms": 156915,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00053",
      "start_ms": 158050,
      "end_ms": 161415,
      "text": "依山洞的罗汉本来整整齐齐坐着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00054",
      "start_ms": 161770,
      "end_ms": 163945,
      "text": "现在被拆散到五六个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00055",
      "start_ms": 164330,
      "end_ms": 165445,
      "text": "再也凑不齐了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00056",
      "start_ms": 166640,
      "end_ms": 167335,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00057",
      "start_ms": 167960,
      "end_ms": 169805,
      "text": "龙门石窟帝后礼佛图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00058",
      "start_ms": 170630,
      "end_ms": 171485,
      "text": "北魏时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00059",
      "start_ms": 171780,
      "end_ms": 176515,
      "text": "洛阳龙门石窟冰阳中洞刻着两幅大型浮雕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00060",
      "start_ms": 176940,
      "end_ms": 178965,
      "text": "一副是孝文帝李佛图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00061",
      "start_ms": 179360,
      "end_ms": 183605,
      "text": "一幅是文昭皇后礼佛图合称帝后里佛土。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00062",
      "start_ms": 184460,
      "end_ms": 188465,
      "text": "这是中国石窟里最精美的北魏时刻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00063",
      "start_ms": 189040,
      "end_ms": 192565,
      "text": "可上世纪三十年代古董商跟美国人勾结，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00064",
      "start_ms": 193010,
      "end_ms": 196025,
      "text": "把这两幅浮雕从石壁上凿下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00065",
      "start_ms": 196440,
      "end_ms": 198015,
      "text": "砸碎偷运出境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00066",
      "start_ms": 198410,
      "end_ms": 202234,
      "text": "孝文帝李佛图卖给了纽约大都会博物馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00067",
      "start_ms": 203040,
      "end_ms": 207255,
      "text": "文昭皇后李佛图卖给了堪萨斯纳尔逊博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00068",
      "start_ms": 208090,
      "end_ms": 209735,
      "text": "您去龙门石窟看看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00069",
      "start_ms": 210150,
      "end_ms": 213835,
      "text": "宾阳中洞那面墙上现在只剩两个大窟窿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00070",
      "start_ms": 214280,
      "end_ms": 215875,
      "text": "石头早走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00071",
      "start_ms": 216120,
      "end_ms": 216955,
      "text": "只剩伤痕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00072",
      "start_ms": 217950,
      "end_ms": 218675,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00073",
      "start_ms": 219370,
      "end_ms": 219610,
      "text": "唐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00074",
      "start_ms": 219650,
      "end_ms": 220830,
      "text": "弘应景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00075",
      "start_ms": 220990,
      "end_ms": 224280,
      "text": "克食这块石头在旅顺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00076",
      "start_ms": 224320,
      "end_ms": 228840,
      "text": "黄金山上刻着二十九个字是唐朝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00077",
      "start_ms": 229000,
      "end_ms": 229965,
      "text": "开元年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00078",
      "start_ms": 230810,
      "end_ms": 236205,
      "text": "洪兄卿催新奉旨册封东北地方政权回来时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00079",
      "start_ms": 236640,
      "end_ms": 238360,
      "text": "路过旅顺凿带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00080",
      "start_ms": 238460,
      "end_ms": 240445,
      "text": "距今一千三百多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00081",
      "start_ms": 240930,
      "end_ms": 244075,
      "text": "这是唐朝对东北行使管辖权的铁证。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00082",
      "start_ms": 245010,
      "end_ms": 247575,
      "text": "一九零八年日俄战争以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00083",
      "start_ms": 247910,
      "end_ms": 251425,
      "text": "日本海军把这块石头和碑亭移起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00084",
      "start_ms": 251740,
      "end_ms": 252745,
      "text": "当成战利品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00085",
      "start_ms": 253000,
      "end_ms": 255245,
      "text": "运回的日本献给了日本皇宫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00086",
      "start_ms": 255620,
      "end_ms": 257760,
      "text": "藏在皇宫里的建安府蜜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00087",
      "start_ms": 257760,
      "end_ms": 259565,
      "text": "不是人一百多年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00088",
      "start_ms": 260410,
      "end_ms": 262225,
      "text": "中国民间多次追讨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00089",
      "start_ms": 263090,
      "end_ms": 265965,
      "text": "日本方面至今没有正式答复。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00090",
      "start_ms": 266380,
      "end_ms": 267315,
      "text": "一块石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00091",
      "start_ms": 267670,
      "end_ms": 268875,
      "text": "一千三百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00092",
      "start_ms": 269740,
      "end_ms": 271945,
      "text": "被锁在别人家的皇宫里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00093",
      "start_ms": 273280,
      "end_ms": 273885,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00094",
      "start_ms": 274430,
      "end_ms": 279845,
      "text": "王羲之丧乱帖书圣王羲之的字真迹早就没有了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00095",
      "start_ms": 280720,
      "end_ms": 282535,
      "text": "传世的都是魔本。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00096",
      "start_ms": 282870,
      "end_ms": 287455,
      "text": "丧乱铁是唐代内府双沟田末模本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00097",
      "start_ms": 288260,
      "end_ms": 292625,
      "text": "被学者认为是王羲之传世书籍中最好的一幅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00098",
      "start_ms": 293120,
      "end_ms": 294120,
      "text": "唐朝的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00099",
      "start_ms": 294260,
      "end_ms": 296115,
      "text": "由遣唐使带到了日本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00100",
      "start_ms": 296560,
      "end_ms": 298115,
      "text": "先藏在东大寺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00101",
      "start_ms": 298620,
      "end_ms": 301480,
      "text": "后来辗转到了日本皇室手里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00102",
      "start_ms": 301940,
      "end_ms": 304420,
      "text": "一千多年来一直密藏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00103",
      "start_ms": 304480,
      "end_ms": 306040,
      "text": "在日本宫内厅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00104",
      "start_ms": 306600,
      "end_ms": 308000,
      "text": "从不对外展出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00105",
      "start_ms": 308440,
      "end_ms": 309980,
      "text": "一直到二零零六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00106",
      "start_ms": 310060,
      "end_ms": 312680,
      "text": "他才第一次回到中国展出。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00107",
      "start_ms": 313120,
      "end_ms": 315300,
      "text": "在上海博物馆待了没几天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00108",
      "start_ms": 315540,
      "end_ms": 316380,
      "text": "又回去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00109",
      "start_ms": 316980,
      "end_ms": 319080,
      "text": "一千三百年就回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00110",
      "start_ms": 319080,
      "end_ms": 320020,
      "text": "过这么一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00111",
      "start_ms": 320880,
      "end_ms": 324840,
      "text": "从第十道第六兽首走散了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00112",
      "start_ms": 324840,
      "end_ms": 329510,
      "text": "一百六十多年罗汉被拆散到五六个国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00113",
      "start_ms": 330070,
      "end_ms": 332690,
      "text": "帝后李佛图只剩两个窟窿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00114",
      "start_ms": 333110,
      "end_ms": 335750,
      "text": "红垦井刻石锁在日本皇宫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00115",
      "start_ms": 336230,
      "end_ms": 338610,
      "text": "丧乱铁一千年只回来过一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00116",
      "start_ms": 339470,
      "end_ms": 342690,
      "text": "可这五件还不是最让人心疼的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00117",
      "start_ms": 343610,
      "end_ms": 348310,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一一件比一件揪心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00118",
      "start_ms": 348910,
      "end_ms": 352550,
      "text": "有一件被大英博物馆切成好几块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00119",
      "start_ms": 353290,
      "end_ms": 354530,
      "text": "装在了木板上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00120",
      "start_ms": 354850,
      "end_ms": 357230,
      "text": "还有一件整面墙被剥走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00121",
      "start_ms": 357310,
      "end_ms": 358125,
      "text": "它是哪件？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00122",
      "start_ms": 358380,
      "end_ms": 361255,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_5ae6f6253ad7b999_s00123",
      "start_ms": 361580,
      "end_ms": 364995,
      "text": "您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
